# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_HQ-Brussels / interface "ZIA location 1001"
#   zone FWS_Branch-Ghent / interface "ZIA location 1002"
#   zone FWS_HQ-Servers / interface "ZIA location 1003"
#   zone FWS_Guest-WiFi / interface "ZIA location 1004"
#   zone FWS_road-warrior / interface "Zscaler Client Connector outsid"
#   zone FWS_internet / interface internet
# Written inactive:
#   Block malicious IPs and domains: not converted: destination IP categories BOTNET, MALWARE_SITE
#   Office 365 One Click Rule: not converted: network applications SHAREPOINT_ONLINE, OUTLOOK_ONLINE
#   Branch web: schedule 'Work hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times
#   Engineers to SaaS: not converted: destination group SaaS-Domains: a destination group of FQDNs (DSTN_FQDN), which the model does not hold; not converted: groups Engineering; references 'SaaS-Domains': a destination group of FQDNs (DSTN_FQDN), which the model does not hold
#   No embargoed countries: not converted: destination countries COUNTRY_KP
#   Evaluate apps: not converted: action EVAL_NWAPP: the decision waits for the network application, which is not modelled
#   Ranked web: not converted: destination FQDN files.example.org
#   Ghent and corporate: not converted: both locations and location groups: how ZIA combines them is not known
